    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n83792" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πλήκ-της</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ου</span>, ὁ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>striker, brawler,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Ep.</u>
				19
			</span></i> (pl., v. l. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρῆκται</span>), <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>EE</u>
				1221b14
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>1 Ep.Ti.</u>
				3.3
			</span></i>; <i>violent, fierce,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄνδρες π. καὶ μάχιμοι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Dio</u>
					30
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Phil.</u>
				9
			</span></i>; of wine, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. καὶ ὀξύς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					2.132d
				</span></i>
			; of the sun, ib.<i><span class="en">
				920c
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				653f
			</span></i>: 
				Sup.
			
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πληκτίστατος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Eust.
					1441.26
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				<u>EM</u>
				31.16
			</span></i>.</div>
